        <div><a name="_chinese" id="_chinese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.8 Chinese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8f4eb074-46d8-4865-918e-f30cc9861ea7" id="_8f4eb074-46d8-4865-918e-f30cc9861ea7"></a>Chinese personal names are names used by those from mainland China, Hong Kong,
Macau, Taiwan, and the Chinese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a97281b2-0024-4763-ac8e-89bda4e5facd" id="_a97281b2-0024-4763-ac8e-89bda4e5facd"></a>Chinese names consist of a
family name (&#x59D3;, x&#xEC;ng), followed by
a given name (&#x540D;, m&#xED;ng).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_5c32e1a8-f51e-43cb-ad33-e19961add241" id="_5c32e1a8-f51e-43cb-ad33-e19961add241"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_28391a63-34a7-4f56-99f6-aed9fe955bb7" id="_28391a63-34a7-4f56-99f6-aed9fe955bb7"></a>Some people also utilize a &#x201C;courtesy name&#x201D; or &#x201C;style name&#x201D; (&#x5B57;, z&#xEC;),
by which they were known among those outside their
family and closest friends.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_representations" id="_typical_name_representations"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.8.1 Typical name representations</p><div class="example"><a name="_0ec2451e-91a1-43fd-b055-04e94ba9d557" id="_0ec2451e-91a1-43fd-b055-04e94ba9d557"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x6587;&#x201D; (Sun Man), the birth name of the founding father
of the Republic of China &#x201C;Sun Yat-sen&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.1</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_6c400b71-c764-4f97-89d1-d472057c9b3f" id="_6c400b71-c764-4f97-89d1-d472057c9b3f"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x6587;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_53419013-9918-44da-a3dd-b61809a9956f" id="_53419013-9918-44da-a3dd-b61809a9956f"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x5FB7;&#x660E;&#x201D; (Sun De Ming), the genealogical name (&#x8B5C;&#x540D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.2</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f7af9127-3c1d-4c98-a3d4-d01a29f8a179" id="_f7af9127-3c1d-4c98-a3d4-d01a29f8a179"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5FB7;&#x660E;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
