        <div><a name="_jewish" id="_jewish"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.24 Jewish</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a172d2d1-6daf-4a60-b835-443bbbd6c60a" id="_a172d2d1-6daf-4a60-b835-443bbbd6c60a"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo30;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
