<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.42</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f79ac1b6-a4d7-4128-b54f-e6ea95b4e0e1" id="_f79ac1b6-a4d7-4128-b54f-e6ea95b4e0e1"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_10" id="_examples_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.30.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_5c918db0-9c46-4847-b8a8-5ff1b1750abd" id="_5c918db0-9c46-4847-b8a8-5ff1b1750abd"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Tuli&#x161;en&#x201D;</p></div>
