  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7c560520-9706-4ed5-bef6-7d6ae8caf5bf" id="_7c560520-9706-4ed5-bef6-7d6ae8caf5bf"></a>Mongolian names traditionally consists of only one personal name.</p>
