    family name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_00d460e3-265e-49e6-b3c6-e2fe9bb2fd71" id="_00d460e3-265e-49e6-b3c6-e2fe9bb2fd71"></a>Vietnamese personal names are names used by those from Vietnam and the
Vietnamese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_28185994-fb94-4089-98d3-dd6c1719d15c" id="_28185994-fb94-4089-98d3-dd6c1719d15c"></a>Vietnamese names consist of a family name (T&#xEA;n, &#x20E1B;),
followed by a given name (H&#x1ECD;, /&#x22A5C;).
Between the family name and given name,
one or more additional names may be present.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4f32b532-f441-4080-90b9-644defd5e3a1" id="_4f32b532-f441-4080-90b9-644defd5e3a1"></a>Vietnamese additional names can be a
middle name (t&#xEA;n &#x111;&#x1EC7;m),
generational name,
or clan distinguisher name. The middle name, for identification purposes, can be omitted.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9380dc64-e859-4772-b81c-97be999f6b59" id="_9380dc64-e859-4772-b81c-97be999f6b59"></a>Courtesy names are also allowed, separate from the given name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_16" id="_typical_name_patterns_16"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.48.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.51</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f363d798-de1d-402b-9b3c-7fadaeb35faf" id="_f363d798-de1d-402b-9b3c-7fadaeb35faf"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.52</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_c94f287a-14f6-436f-be31-7f96fd7076c1" id="_c94f287a-14f6-436f-be31-7f96fd7076c1"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.53</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f86fe2dc-c308-4848-a35e-b075baffd367" id="_f86fe2dc-c308-4848-a35e-b075baffd367"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">additonal name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
